        "created_at": "2014-02-24T15:39:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I prefer recognizing homages rather than claiming a character is basically another established character. Dr. Blake Washington, Jr. becoming Ra with The Staff of Ra is a clear homage to Dr. Donald Blake becoming Thor with The Hammer of Thor, for example.</p>",
