        "created_at": "2014-02-24T17:25:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's why I usually use archetypes, not direct comparsions.</p><p>Setback is the hard luck everyman.</p><p>Legacy is the paragon of goodness.</p><p>Haka is the heavy.</p><p>Omnitron X is the robot.</p><p>Etc.</p>",
