        "created_at": "2014-02-24T20:19:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I only use the analogs to get new players' attention. Then, when we're in the thick of things I spring trivia on them.</p><p>Everyone loves a good trivia assault.</p><p>Example: I kept good friend from quitting their first game by explaining Tachyon's peronsal life and relation to How I Met your Mother. However, they only picked Tachyon because she was \"like Quicksilver...\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
